  FAN-4': dec_A' = [sum_{j<=p} D_j] - C(p,2) - [p(L+1) - E], with
          sum_{j<=p} D_j = sum_{B_hi} deg - C(p,2) = (p*tau - 2nu + R) - C(p,2)
          claim: dec_A' = R - 2nu + E, hence A'-total = R - dec_A' = 2nu - E
