    grid points: 55296
  FAN-8' value chain, symbolic:
     v_t(c) >= tau-(t-1) = tau-t+1   [c escapes at t, decremented <= t-1 times]
     v_t(x) >= v_t(c)                [block is a prefix, c not in it, x in it]
     v_{p+1}(x) >= v_t(x) - (p-t+1)  [x survives steps t..p, <=1 decrement each]
     v_{p+1}(x) <= 2nu - E           [FAN-4' A'-mass]
     => tau-t+1 <= (2nu-E) + (p-t+1) => tau-p = L <= 2nu-E   QED
